    "Move persistence liveness/readiness to service operation and revision checks to configuration synchronization.",
    "Keep installer behavior outside the baseline and factory Windows labels as compatibility notes.",
    "Remove frontend-only field checks as the sole evidence for backend setting validation.",
    "Record UTF-16 message-content limits separately from byte-based HTTP and output limits."
  ]
